  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Mec 302.06 Local Permit Eligibility. A licensed business entity shall apply for and obtain a permit from any municipality within the state pursuant to RSA 153:29-a, V.\n\nSource. #10648, EMERGENCY RULE, eff 7-25-14, EXPIRES: 1-21-15; ss by #10761, INTERIM, eff 1-21-15, EXPIRES: 7-20-15; ss by #10847, eff 7-1-15 (from Saf-Mec 301.07); ss by #13770, eff 12-10-23 (formerly Saf-Mec 302.06) (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Mec 300)",
